WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.310
The rain... Yes.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.560
The little drops that
shower down on us...

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.400
...have quenched our thirst
or flooded us with grief.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.330
At times gentle
and at times hard.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.700
Tonight, this rain will
descend like a downpour...

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.120
...upon the past of
a man and a woman.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.120
How will it end?

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:50.580
What sort of fate will the two
find themselves flooded with?

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.400
Perhaps, if it hadn't
been raining...

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.800
...the two may not have been
concerned with such thoughts.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:02.800
Neo Turkey
Minaret Gundam

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.610
Today's opponent is...

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.680
...Neo Turkey's Minaret Gundam.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:03.930
And now!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:09.060
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:15.190
Reunion in the Falling Rain

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.160
I've heard those rumors.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.330
That this nation's Gundam
suddenly went wild...

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.670
...and destroyed the west side
of Istanbul.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.750
If word got out to the
rest of the world...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.560
...it would be a disgrace
to our proud nation.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.060
Look at that.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.940
Armed police are desperately
searching for something.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.140
No matter.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.300
Life will always be a mystery.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.310
God sees everything.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:51.690
The truth will eventually
reveal itself.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.200
What's taking Domon so long?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.870
Well, at least he's consistent.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.090
Saette?!

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.740
Yes.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.840
My major was in medicine and
his was mechanical engineering.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.670
He also happened to be
captain of the wrestling team.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.070
This is back when I was
enrolled at Colony University.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.220
So, those two were classmates.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.300
I'd better leave them alone.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.910
A Gundam start key?

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.570
Could he be...?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.740
Long time no see.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:28.910
Y-yeah.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.910
I can't believe we'd bump
into each other at a place like this.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.290
Yeah, I know.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.790
But this is your hometown,
after all...

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.750
I suppose it's not that strange.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:41.170
You remembered all this time
that this is my hometown.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.210
Well, why shouldn't I...?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.350
More importantly,
I should check that out.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:53.770
Here...

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.690
Let me see your arm.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.390
No, that's...

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:00.980
What's this?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:03.330
Devil Gundam cells!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.410
This is very unfortunate.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.870
The Devil Gundam,
along with Kyoji Kasshu...

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.450
...has escaped to Earth.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.660
We conducted a search
of Dr. Kasshu's lab...

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.630
...hoping to find something
that would help prepare us...

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.920
...to confront the Devil Gundam.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.470
And from the data that
we recovered...

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.680
...we discovered something
quite horrifying.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.060
Here you see the mouse
being administered...

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:43.220
...with Devil Gundam cells,
or DG cells, for short.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.900
The astounding thing is that
it's a type of metal...

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.200
...yet can bond with organic cells.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.450
Mitosis then occurs,
just like with a living cell...

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.120
...and it spreads throughout
the body.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.120
As cell division progresses...

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.460
...the skin transforms into metal.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.840
At this stage,
treatment is still possible...

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.710
...but once the cells
reach the brain...

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:09.260
...the infected host becomes a
slave to the Devil Gundam...

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.260
...transforming into a beast
bent on slaughter and destruction.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.190
In this way,
it increases its numbers.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:33.660
It is one of the three theoretical
abilities that Dr. Kasshu developed.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.160
That is, self-multiplication.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.870
And most alarming of all is that...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.590
...if any one of us comes in
contact with this DG cell...

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.760
...we will likely end up
in a similar state.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.670
Yes, in a similar state.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.930
Rain...

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.010
Rain!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.550
I guess you're surprised.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.310
I've had this disease...

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.350
...but it's almost better.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.520
But it should be examined properly.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.400
I am a doctor, after all.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.390
Saette. Please.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.860
Fine. But you'll have to
promise me something.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.120
I don't want you to tell
anyone else about this.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.450
A doctor is obliged to keep
a patient's condition confidential.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.500
Thank you.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.160
At this stage,
treatment is still possible...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.790
...but once they reach the brain...

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.500
...they become beasts bent on
slaughter and destruction.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.650
Bent on slaughter and destruction...

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.750
You haven't asked me about it.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.750
I suppose everyone's
got their reasons.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.970
Rain on Earth is so inconvenient.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.720
We never know when
it's going to stop.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.850
"Falling Rain."

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:22.180
That's what they called it when rain
was scheduled at the Colony, right?

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.650
Come to think of it...

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.940
...it was raining on that day, too.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:29.360
Rain?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.530
Your name really is Rain?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.400
Yes.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.610
My dad says...

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.490
..."Rain is a blessing."

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:39.450
"Be one who gives relief to others,
as the rain does to the earth."

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.580
Strange, huh?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.530
So that's why.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.460
But on that rainy day,
and all the days that followed...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.670
...you disappeared from my life.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.170
Yes.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.970
It was some time after that I
finally heard what happened.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.330
That you'd gone back to Neo Japan.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:06.480
But I had to see you that day.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.660
I'm sorry.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.260
I'm not upset about it.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.910
We did meet again, after all.
Right?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.160
Is that Domon guy
your boyfriend?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.420
Or perhaps your husband?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.420
We just work together.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.760
Nothing more than that.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.090
I see.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.130
S-Saette...

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.150
Rain...

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.530
Please, you have to help me.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:41.450
Don't abandon me.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.390
Rain.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.330
Rain!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.290
What's going on?
What're you so excited about?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.630
What happened here?

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.460
What do you mean?

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.340
You're acting strange.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.640
Everything's fine.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.560
This guy's a Gundam Fighter,
isn't he?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.420
Just as I thought.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.440
Domon.
What do you plan on doing?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.770
Isn't it obvious?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.360
He's going to tell me where he
came across the Devil Gundam.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.280
Even if it means a Gundam Fight.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.780
But he's sick.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.700
I can't allow you to do that!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.830
Aren't you supposed
to be my partner?!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.290
I'm a doctor as well.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.290
As a doctor, I can't allow him to do
anything that worsens his condition!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:36.380
Just as a doctor, huh?
Is that all?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:51.270
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.030
Why the long face?

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.690
Your woman run away from you
or something?

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.950
It's not possible for any of us
to run away.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.000
We're all like birds in a cage.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.670
I became a Gundam Fighter...

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.700
...shortly after you left.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:25.090
I was recognized for my
mechanical engineering...

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:27.600
...and the skills I'd developed
in the wrestling program.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.110
An endless world of battles
and destruction.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.600
A world that gentle people like you
will never have to experience.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.560
Then one day...

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.180
It was unbelievably strong.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.930
I was hit many times.
I had no chance to retaliate.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.250
The next thing I realized,
the pilot was gone.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.780
And ever since...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.530
Whenever I am in my Gundam...

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.640
...there are times when
I'd lose consciousness.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.240
Lose consciousness?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.370
That's right.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.390
Once, when I came to...

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.770
I had been fighting
for the pride of my country...

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.240
...but I had gone and destroyed
my own hometown.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.320
I got scared.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.280
I just hid my Gundam
and disappeared.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.250
Then I lost consciousness again.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.280
When I woke up,
you were there.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.790
Perhaps something is
bringing us together.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.800
It's now time for you to
take your tranquilizer.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.920
Where are you going?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.220
I don't know when I might
have another fit.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.410
I can't stay here with you.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.180
But if you leave,
they'll catch you right away.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.350
But if I stay here...

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.810
...I might end up killing you
or something.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.820
I'm a doctor.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.480
I won't just abandon my patient.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.530
Because you're a doctor?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.370
That day...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.760
...I was going to meet you
to make a decision.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.340
Whether I would train for
a future as a Gundam Fighter...

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.610
...or remain at the University
with you.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.360
Did you not come that day...

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.850
...because you lost interest in me?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:18.600
That's not it.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.100
Then why didn't you?!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.070
Looks like they found you.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.980
Their main force is assembling
on the main street.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.840
If they find out you've been
harboring me...

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.310
...they'll arrest you, too.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.470
I'll create a diversion...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.760
...because I want you to get away.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.640
Now.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.170
Saette!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:57.810
Forget it.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.420
Take good care of Rain.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.760
Saette, you can't!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.320
After him! Don't let him escape!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.660
Goodbye, Rain.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.170
Saette...!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.300
The DG cells have begun to
take over.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.640
We've got no choice.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.850
Wait, Domon!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.480
Don't ask me to try to save him!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.350
Our objective...

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.060
...is to fight until we corner
the Devil Gundam...

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.980
...no matter who we end up fighting.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.190
But...

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.930
Gundam!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.660
Whoever's in charge up above
sure likes to play with destiny.

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:03.260
But we can still settle matters
with a Gundam Fight!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.270
Ready!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:07.030
Go!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.780
Is it over?

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.490
What?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.410
The Devil Gundam's ability
to self-recover!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:25.910
Then take this!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.170
No!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.550
Domon! Saette!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.070
Stop it, Saette!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.280
Saette!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.080
Get back!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.950
He's now a slave of
the Devil Gundam!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.080
He's not the man you know!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.630
Saette's brain hasn't been infected
by the DG cells yet.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.840
The fact that he accepted
your challenge is proof!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.760
If he can hear me...

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.300
...there's still a chance
that he'll recover!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:22.300
Saette!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.010
Please!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.260
Listen to me!

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:29.230
I remember that day well.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.440
Falling Rain...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.990
It rained as planned.

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:38.530
I was getting ready to go
to our meeting spot.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.240
But...

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.450
Yes?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.820
Oh, Father?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:45.830
Huh?

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.730
Yes.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.960
But you can't expect me to go
on such short notice.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.040
What? Dr. Kasshu?!

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:56.170
But, why?!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.520
What?
When did Domon return?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.130
Yes, yes...

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:04.590
I was called by my father...

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:08.140
...and had to return
to Neo Japan immediately!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.980
It wasn't that I lost interest
in you, so please...!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:14.270
Saette, please...

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.110
Please return to the person
I loved!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.780
Please!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.740
Saette!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.000
Rain...

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.920
Saette!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.170
Move! Rain!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.000
Now's my only chance
to defeat him!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.420
Don't!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.050
Don't kill Saette!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.430
That's enough!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:50.520
I'll defeat anyone who's come
in contact with the Devil Gundam!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.430
Regardless of who it is!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.980
Saette!

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.230
Aren't you going to stay?

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:42.440
Saette had a disease, so I'm sure
they'll let him off easy.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.340
We'll let the hospital
take care of the rest.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.030
I see.

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.950
My work as a doctor is finished.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.780
I think I can return
to being your partner now.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.710
Thank you, Domon!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:02.250
I just didn't want this nation to get
information on the Devil Gundam.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:32.240
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:36.620
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:41.080
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:44.630
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:51.800
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:02.770
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:13.450
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:19.460
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.050
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:38.270
Tokyo has been reduced to rubble
by a mysterious mobile suit force.

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:42.190
And Domon and Rain are
rescued by a martial arts master.

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:45.110
The master is Domon's teacher...

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:48.030
...the former King of Hearts.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:50.610
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:53.070
He's the Undefeated of the East!

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.270
Master Asia Appears.

00:23:53.870 --> 00:24:00.510
He's the Undefeated of the East!
Master Asia Appears

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.240
Ready! Go!
